# Cursor brand & visual style

This is a company-neutral **Cursor** demo. Keep everything on-brand and sleek;
never hardcode another company's branding.

## Colors — dark mode (default)
- Background `#14120B` · Cards `#1B1913` · Borders `#2B2923`
- Text `#EDECEC` (muted = 60% opacity)
- Accent: **Cursor orange `#F54E00`** — use it sparingly, for the one thing that
  should stand out.

## Colors — light mode (if asked)
- Background `#F7F7F4` · Text `#26251E` · Accent `#F54E00`

Tokens live in `design/design-tokens.json` — reuse those values, don't invent new
hex codes.

## Style
- Minimal and uncluttered: generous spacing, one or two type weights, one accent.
- Charts: muted/neutral series + a single accent color for the key story.
- Slides: clean or dark background, big numbers, one idea per slide, no clip art.
